@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 토큰 발급: 200 {accessToken(15분), refreshToken(7일)}
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginId":"kdt01","password":"kdt1234"}

> {%
    client.global.set("access", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refresh", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 2. access로 내 정보: 200
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 3. refresh를 Bearer로: 401 (tokenType=refresh라 parseAccess가 거절)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh}}

### 4. 재발급: 200 새 access·refresh (비밀번호 없이)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{refresh}}"}

> {%
    client.global.set("access", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refresh", response.body.refreshToken);
%}

### 5. access로 재발급 시도: 401 (tokenType=access라 parseRefresh가 거절)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken":"{{access}}"}

### 6. 빈 refresh: 400 INVALID_INPUT
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}
